### Feature Payment — UPDATE (PUT) / UPDATE (PATCH) (JWT + RBAC)
### `is_active` no se envía: solo cambia con PATCH /api/pagos/:id/deactivate
@baseUrl = http://localhost:4000
@token = {{login.response.body.$.access_token}}
@id = 1

### LOGIN como admin (ejecutar PRIMERO: guarda el token en @token)
# @name login
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/sesion/login
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "identifier": "admin",
  "password": "Admin123!"
}

### PUT — reemplazo completo
PUT {{baseUrl}}/api/pagos/{{id}}
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "referencia_tipo": "PEDIDO",
  "referencia_id": 1,
  "metodo": "TARJETA",
  "monto": 18500,
  "fecha": "2026-10-14T09:30:00",
  "estado": "COMPLETADO"
}

### PATCH — parcial (confirmar un pago pendiente)
PATCH {{baseUrl}}/api/pagos/{{id}}
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "estado": "COMPLETADO"
}
